      "id": "node-03-html-css-base",
      "type": "code",
      "title": "Langkah 1 — HTML dan CSS Aplikasi",
      "xp": 5,
      "explanation": "Mulai dari HTML semantik yang lengkap dan CSS yang bagus — TANPA JavaScript dulu. Buka di browser: tampak bagus tapi belum berfungsi. Ini adalah fondasi yang benar.",
      "code": {
        "language": "html",
        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"id\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <title>Mini Note App</title>\n    <style>\n      * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f0f4f8; padding: 32px; }\n      .app { max-width: 520px; }\n      h1 { font-size: 24px; color: #1a202c; margin-bottom: 24px; }\n      .form-kartu { background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; margin-bottom: 24px; }\n      label { display: block; font-size: 13px; color: #4a5568; margin-bottom: 4px; font-weight: bold; }\n      input, textarea { width: 100%; padding: 9px 12px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 14px; font-family: inherit; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n      textarea { height: 80px; resize: vertical; }\n      button.btn-tambah { background: #3182ce; color: #fff; border: none; padding: 10px 24px; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold; width: 100%; }\n      #pesan-form { font-size: 13px; color: #c53030; min-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n      .area-catatan h2 { font-size: 16px; color: #4a5568; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n      #jumlah-catatan { font-weight: bold; color: #2b6cb0; }\n      #daftar-catatan { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }\n      .catatan-item { background: #fff; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }\n      .c-judul { font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; color: #1a202c; margin-bottom: 6px; }\n      .c-isi { font-size: 14px; color: #4a5568; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n      .btn-hapus { background: #fff5f5; color: #c53030; border: 1px solid #fed7d7; padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; }\n    </style>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <div class=\"app\">\n      <h1>Catatan Mini</h1>\n      <div class=\"form-kartu\">\n        <div id=\"pesan-form\"></div>\n        <label>Judul</label>\n        <input type=\"text\" id=\"input-judul\" placeholder=\"Judul catatan...\">\n        <label>Isi Catatan</label>\n        <textarea id=\"input-isi\" placeholder=\"Tulis isinya...\"></textarea>\n        <button class=\"btn-tambah\" id=\"btn-tambah\">+ Tambah Catatan</button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"area-catatan\">\n        <h2>Catatan (<span id=\"jumlah-catatan\">0</span>)</h2>\n        <div id=\"daftar-catatan\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </body>\n</html>"
      }
