      "expectedResult": "Mini aplikasi interaktif yang berfungsi dengan form validasi, event handlers, functions terorganisir, dan konten dinamis.",
      "solution": {
        "language": "html",
        "code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"id\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <title>To-Do List</title>\n    <style>\n      * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f0f4f8; padding: 32px; }\n      .app { max-width: 460px; }\n      h1 { font-size: 22px; color: #1a202c; margin-bottom: 20px; }\n      .row { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n      input { flex: 1; padding: 10px 12px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 14px; }\n      .btn-add { background: #3182ce; color: #fff; border: none; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold; }\n      #err { font-size: 13px; color: #c53030; min-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n      .stats { font-size: 13px; color: #718096; margin-bottom: 14px; }\n      #daftar { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }\n      .item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; background: #fff; padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }\n      .teks { flex: 1; font-size: 14px; color: #2d3748; }\n      .teks.done { text-decoration: line-through; color: #a0aec0; }\n      .btn-ok { background: #f0fff4; color: #276749; border: 1px solid #c6f6d5; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; }\n      .btn-del { background: #fff5f5; color: #c53030; border: 1px solid #fed7d7; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; }\n    </style>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <div class=\"app\">\n      <h1>To-Do List Saya</h1>\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <input type=\"text\" id=\"inp\" placeholder=\"Tugas baru...\">\n        <button class=\"btn-add\" id=\"btn\">Tambah</button>\n      </div>\n      <div id=\"err\"></div>\n      <div class=\"stats\" id=\"stats\">0 tugas</div>\n      <div id=\"daftar\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <script>\n      // function 1: validasi\n      function validasiInput(t) { return t.trim() !== ''; }\n\n      // function 2: update stats\n      function updateStats() {\n        const n = document.querySelectorAll('.item').length;\n        const d = document.querySelectorAll('.teks.done').length;\n        document.getElementById('stats').textContent = n + ' tugas, ' + d + ' selesai';\n      }\n\n      // function 3: tambah tugas\n      function tambahTugas(teks) {\n        const div = document.createElement('div');\n        div.className = 'item';\n        div.innerHTML = '<span class=\"teks\">' + teks + '</span><button class=\"btn-ok\">Selesai</button><button class=\"btn-del\">Hapus</button>';\n        div.querySelector('.btn-ok').addEventListener('click', function() {\n          div.querySelector('.teks').classList.toggle('done'); updateStats();\n        });\n        div.querySelector('.btn-del').addEventListener('click', function() {\n          div.remove(); updateStats();\n        });\n        document.getElementById('daftar').appendChild(div);\n        updateStats();\n      }\n\n      // Event listeners\n      document.getElementById('btn').addEventListener('click', function() {\n        const t = document.getElementById('inp').value;\n        if (!validasiInput(t)) { document.getElementById('err').textContent = 'Tidak boleh kosong.'; return; }\n        document.getElementById('err').textContent = '';\n        tambahTugas(t);\n        document.getElementById('inp').value = '';\n      });\n\n      document.getElementById('inp').addEventListener('keydown', function(e) {\n        if (e.key === 'Enter') document.getElementById('btn').click();\n      });\n    </script>\n  </body>\n</html>",
        "explanation": "Contoh solusi to-do list dengan tiga function yang masing-masing punya satu tanggung jawab: validasiInput() hanya mengecek apakah teks tidak kosong, updateStats() hanya menghitung dan menampilkan statistik, tambahTugas() membuat elemen baru dan menambahkan event listener ke tombol selesai dan hapus. Event listener tambah dan enter key memanggil function-function ini secara terkoordinasi."
      }
